    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Alison Victoria",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108351916799862430503/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcJE1kxsgapyobBUD9nqiZfgvtKNuXm_KJh8qatqh6td1Cenlmqw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "This employee has an extremely bad attitude. I was on the phone with my mother and I had just gotten my new iPhone 17 Pro Max but I had my other phone in my hand  and she started asking me all kinds of questions as somebody else was serving me. She was like why do you have two cell phones let me verify the age of the person you’re on the phone with none of this is any of her business. The person I was dealing with was already about to sell me and then all of a sudden she comes in acting like she runs the place. She needs to be disciplined, and I will never come back to this SQDC again.",
        "time": 1762637235,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brenda Valiquette",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100004240884969116402/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLjYJk2qMWtVPTWavl1ldb1coJ8o503E3MctV_JIM6CbabI3g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Just spoke to a lady and she was extremely rude over the phone, French lady. Very rude. I won’t be bringing my business here.",
        "time": 1768418222,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jon Subi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107859468269213513181/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLttg7rlqhz5bRjGrtxT8bk_z0HNegIx5I10vYvcKB_aFVXZKc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "A sterile sanitized appearence, clean but hard to know what youre looking at, but this is the gov not the stores own choice, other than that great staff and great selection, very much improved since the initial opening yeara ago.",
        "time": 1743879895,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "stuart brown",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103453944075113514354/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLNWTj3-AUtiCcbYaI6mdF6WNjFLzOjGGydzJquSZ23iqnJ6A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "This SQDC outlet is great because it's very close to my house, and it is rarely packed with people like the downtown stores. This means I can get in and out with no fuss and no delay. Selections are good, the staff are quite friendly and perfectly bilingual. No complaints.",
        "time": 1654355623,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Téra",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116377924506688820974/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0X6fs9L3o4IBzy8_3JRq47tCWOeZX7doOiZjWkertrDZ6I5mblg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "My bf and I go here very often. The staff is so friendly - especially Marvin, who is very knowledgeable of the products and always has recommendations. Always in stock for what we need, never had a line-up (knock on wood).\nBy far our favorite outlet!",
        "time": 1664718975,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
